+    /// Removes all interactions in the given thread that were authored (sent)
+    /// by the local user, leaving other participants' interactions intact.
+    /// Sends a `DeleteForMe` sync message so linked devices reflect the same
+    /// removal.
+    func removeAllInteractionsAuthoredByLocalUser(
